

translate es strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:11
    old "The Human Experience"
    new "La experiencia humana"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:12
    old "Now that I have found a place for Myu to stay, I've gotta make sure she 'settles in' alright..."
    new "Ahora que he encontrado un lugar para Myu, tengo que asegurarme de que se 'instale' bien..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Check up on Myu"
    new "Ve a ver a Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "I should check up on Myu another day, see if she is alright."
    new "Debería ir a ver a Myu otro día, a ver si está bien."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Feed Myu"
    new "Alimenta a Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu's appetites grow. Wonder if I can handle supplying her further... Butcher at the market should have more meat I can bring her."
    new "El apetito de Myu crece. Me pregunto si podré continuar alimentándola... El carnicero del mercado debería tener más carne que pueda llevarle."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Teach Myu some Alderian"
    new "Enseña a Myu algo de alderiano"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu wants 'words'. A slimelark that speaks... This is going to be interesting."
    new "Myu quiere 'palabras'. Un slimelark que habla... Esto va a ser interesante."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Grab a book on Alderian language"
    new "Consigue un libro sobre el lenguaje alderiano"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Perhaps I can speed up teaching Myu if I can find a book on Alderian language. I should try Novaras Library."
    new "Quizá pueda acelerar la enseñanza de Myu si encuentro un libro sobre la lengua alderiana. Debería probar en la biblioteca de Novaras."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Bring the books collection to Myu"
    new "Lleva la colección de libros a Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "I feel like I've just bought half the library out. Hope these books will help Myu learn to speak."
    new "Siento que acabo de comprar la mitad de la biblioteca. Espero que estos libros ayuden a Myu a aprender a hablar."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Let Myu study"
    new "Deja estudiar a Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "I gave Myu a huge collection of books on Alderian language. I should leave her alone to study for now, maybe check up on her later."
    new "Le di a Myu una enorme colección de libros sobre la lengua alderiana. Debería dejarla sola estudiando por ahora, tal vez luego le haga una visita."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Give Myu a tour of the city"
    new "Recorre la ciudad con Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "We're walking a thin line here. Myu is eager to see 'the world outside', but the world outside will attack her on sight. I hope this works out..."
    new "Estamos caminando en la cuerda floja. Myu está ansiosa por ver 'el mundo exterior', pero el mundo exterior la atacará nada más verla. Espero que esto funcione..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Let Myu rest"
    new "Deja descansar a Myu"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu was excited to see the city. I should check up on her once she processes all the excitement."
    new "Myu estaba emocionada por ver la ciudad. Debería ver cómo estaba una vez que procesara toda la emoción."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Get better food"
    new "Consigue mejor comida"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu doesn't feel right. Maybe some fresh food from the Iron Unicorn tavern can improve her condition?"
    new "Myu no se siente bien. ¿Quizás algo de comida fresca de la taberna del Unicornio de hierro pueda mejorar su estado?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Learn more about slimelarks"
    new "Aprende más sobre slimelarks"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu doesn't feel right... at all! I need to learn about slimelarks. The library could be of use."
    new "Myu no se siente bien... ¡en absoluto! Necesito aprender sobre slimelarks. La biblioteca podría ser útil."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "It seems that slimelarks' diet is not exclusively carnivorous. I need to gather some wildflowers at the Balun lake."
    new "Parece que la dieta de los slimelarks no es exclusivamente carnívora. Tengo que recoger algunas flores silvestres en el lago Balun."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Bring Myu the wildflowers"
    new "Trae a Myu las flores silvestres"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "I have gathered some wildflowers. Really hope this helps Myu get better... Time to go bring them over now."
    new "He recogido algunas flores silvestres. Realmente espero que esto ayude a Myu a mejorar... Es hora de llevárselas."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Take Myu out 'hunting'"
    new "Lleva a Myu de 'caza'"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:13
    old "Myu needs meat to survive. And not the steak kind. I should take her out on the 'hunt' one night."
    new "Myu necesita carne para sobrevivir. Y no del tipo filete. Debería llevarla a 'cazar' una noche."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:89
    old "Here, Myu, some food."
    new "Toma, Myu, algo de comida."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:92
    old "Let's start with the lesson."
    new "Empecemos con la lección."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:95
    old "About these books on Alderian..."
    new "Sobre estos libros de Alderiano..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:97
    old "Do you have any books that help teach Alderian?"
    new "¿Tiene algún libro que ayude a enseñar alderiano?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:100
    old "Give her the books collection."
    new "Dale la colección de libros."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:103
    old "How is your Alderian?"
    new "¿Cómo va tu alderiano?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:107
    old "{image=[ICON.CLOCK]} I'm ready to take you on tour now, Myu."
    new "{image=[ICON.CLOCK]} Estoy listo para llevarte de paseo ahora, Myu."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:109
    old "I was hoping to get some food..."
    new "Esperaba conseguir algo de comida..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:111
    old "Ask for a book about Slimelarks."
    new "Pregunta por un libro sobre slimelarks."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/logic.rpy:114
    old "Come on Myu... It's time to take you hunting."
    new "Vamos Myu... Es hora de llevarte de caza."
